## Manual steps for {{OWNER}}

Do these in order, after the install PR merges. The kit never changes GitHub settings.

- [ ] Confirm the default branch is `main`.
- [ ] Turn on branch protection for `main`: require a PR, require the CI checks to pass, and block force-pushes.
- [ ] Retarget every open PR from `dev` to `main`.
- [ ] Move any `dev`-scoped secrets or environments to the environments `main` uses.
- [ ] Delete the remote `dev` branch last, once nothing targets it.

